1
00:00:00,772 --> 00:00:05,192
(Leonard:)Do you understand that Stephanie's
not here to treat your imaginary ailments?

2
00:00:05,359 --> 00:00:08,489
(Sheldon:)How is it imaginary that
I keep hearing an octave above middle C?

3
00:00:08,654 --> 00:00:10,114
[HUMS]

4
00:00:11,032 --> 00:00:12,072
(Sheldon:)Is that imaginary?

5
00:00:12,241 --> 00:00:13,451
[HUMS]

6
00:00:13,701 --> 00:00:15,661
(Sheldon:)I don't think so.

7
00:00:15,828 --> 00:00:17,408
[HUMS]

8
00:00:19,457 --> 00:00:21,537
- Good night.
- Leonard, there's one more thing.

9
00:00:21,709 --> 00:00:24,169
(Sheldon:)Article One, Section Three
of our roommate agreement.

10
00:00:24,337 --> 00:00:26,757
(Sheldon:)- I'm calling an emergency meeting.
- No, you're not.

11
00:00:26,923 --> 00:00:30,553
(Sheldon:)Leonard moves the meeting not occur.
Second? None heard, the motion fails.

12
00:00:31,844 --> 00:00:35,054
(Sheldon:)I'd like to begin the meeting
by congratulating you on the progress...

13
00:00:35,223 --> 00:00:37,223
(Sheldon:)...in your relationship with Dr. Stephanie.

14
00:00:37,975 --> 00:00:39,555
(Leonard:)- Thank you.
- And that being said...

15
00:00:39,727 --> 00:00:43,147
(Sheldon:)...we have to discuss the implementation
of the cohabitation rider...

16
00:00:43,314 --> 00:00:46,064
(Sheldon:)...which has been activated
now that you're living together.

17
00:00:46,234 --> 00:00:49,824
(Leonard:)- We're not living together.
- I beg to disagree. Ahem.

18
00:00:49,987 --> 00:00:53,237
"A girlfriend shall be deemed, quote,
living with, unquote, Leonard...

19
00:00:53,407 --> 00:00:55,997
...when she has stayed over,
A, 10 consecutive nights...

20
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:59,080
...or B, more than nine nights
in a three-week period, or C...

